01:02:14.000 --> 01:02:16.000
Parivash: And the second one is true. Dr. Khalifa: Yes.

01:02:16.000 --> 01:02:19.000
Dr. Khalifa: And then, you put the lie in between. There it is. Mã Shã Allãh. Parivash: Yes, between.

01:02:19.000 --> 01:02:20.000
Dr. Khalifa: God bless you.

01:02:21.000 --> 01:02:22.000
Dr. Khalifa: I was looking for that.

01:02:23.000 --> 01:02:28.000
A woman: How (unintelligible)

01:02:28.000 --> 01:02:29.000
A woman: How did you say it?

01:02:29.000 --> 01:02:31.000
Dr. Khalifa: Pardon? What's your question?

01:02:31.000 --> 01:02:34.000
A woman: That you put a...

01:02:36.000 --> 01:02:37.000
A man: Wrapping the truth in a...

01:02:37.000 --> 01:02:37.000
Parivash: Wrapping.

01:02:37.000 --> 01:02:39.000
A woman: Wrapping the truth in a falsehood.

01:02:39.000 --> 01:02:43.000
A woman: Yeah, wrapping (unintelligible)

01:02:43.000 --> 01:02:46.000
Dr. Khalifa: In fact, this is... the Quran has a commandment against it that says,

01:02:46.000 --> 01:02:48.000
(2:42) وَلَا تَلْبِسُوا۟ ٱلْحَقَّ بِٱلْبَـٰطِلِ

01:02:48.000 --> 01:02:51.000
[2:42] Do not confound the truth with falsehood, ...

01:02:52.000 --> 01:02:56.000
تَلْبِسُوا۟ ٱلْحَقَّ بِٱلْبَـٰطِلِ means you dress, do not dress the lie with the truth.

01:02:56.000 --> 01:02:58.000
Parivash: Exactly. Allahu Akbar.

01:02:58.000 --> 01:02:59.000
Dr. Khalifa: Yeah.

01:03:00.000 --> 01:03:01.000
تَلْبِسُوا۟ is Libas (لباس).

01:03:01.000 --> 01:03:03.000
Dr. Khalifa: Do you have it in Farsi? A woman: Even if we have to, is that wrong?

01:03:03.000 --> 01:03:04.000
Dr. Khalifa: Yeah.

01:03:06.000 --> 01:03:08.000
Dr. Khalifa: Do you have Libas (لباس) in Farsi?

01:03:08.000 --> 01:03:08.000
A woman: Yes. Parivash: Yes.

01:03:08.000 --> 01:03:09.000
Dr. Khalifa: Ok.

01:03:09.000 --> 01:03:11.000
(2:42) لَا تَلْبِسُوا۟ ٱلْحَقَّ بِٱلْبَـٰطِلِ

01:03:12.000 --> 01:03:22.000
So, a messenger has come to you who is fantastic, is false, and then is a Batil (بَـٰطِلِ), and "God, there is no god except He is truth."

01:03:22.000 --> 01:03:24.000
Dr. Khalifa: So, they wrap this with that. Parivash: Wrap this.

01:03:24.000 --> 01:03:24.000
Parivash: Alhamdu Lillah.

01:03:24.000 --> 01:03:26.000
A woman: So, this (unintelligible)

01:03:26.000 --> 01:03:28.000
Parivash: Yeah, this is, yeah. Dr. Khalifa: Yes.

01:03:28.000 --> 01:03:30.000
Dr. Khalifa: This is, this is the name of God.

01:03:30.000 --> 01:03:31.000
بِٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ رَءُوفٌۭ رَّحِيمٌۭ

01:03:31.000 --> 01:03:33.000
It's used in the Quran exclusively for God.

01:03:35.000 --> 01:03:40.000
Azhar Khan: Sir, with this, we found this after you, since Quran was printed for translation.

01:03:40.000 --> 01:03:41.000
Dr. Khalifa: Yes.

01:03:43.000 --> 01:03:45.000
Azhar Khan: And when was that, about two or three years ago or...?

01:03:46.000 --> 01:03:49.000
Dr. Khalifa: I, I told you what year was that, as soon as I came back from Egypt.

01:03:49.000 --> 01:03:51.000
Dr. Khalifa: She's the memory of the group.

01:03:52.000 --> 01:03:55.000
A woman: Who are we teaching over here? (unintelligible) Dr. Khalifa: (unintelligible) A woman: Around 84.

01:03:56.000 --> 01:03:59.000
Dr. Khalifa: 84? Yeah, it was 1984. I came back from Egypt.

01:03:59.000 --> 01:04:09.000
What happened was, we, we formed a committee, and we sat to count the word "God" in the Quran one by one, you know, page by page.

01:04:10.000 --> 01:04:15.000
And in the end, we found one extra, 2698... 2699.

01:04:16.000 --> 01:04:21.000
So, right there and then, I stood up and I said "this means the two verses", that was

01:04:21.000 --> 01:04:26.000
the one piece of evidence I needed, finally, to say that the two verses are false.

01:04:27.000 --> 01:04:29.000
They wanted to kill me right there and then.

01:04:30.000 --> 01:04:33.000
So, I came back and I, I announced it.

01:04:34.000 --> 01:04:40.000
Dr. Khalifa: That's right, because it came out in the March 1985 issue, the Muslim Perspective.

01:04:40.000 --> 01:04:42.000
A man: Yes, I think I remember that.

01:04:42.000 --> 01:04:44.000
Dr. Khalifa: Yeah, yeah, March 85.

01:04:49.000 --> 01:04:50.000
Dr. Khalifa: So, that's when it happened.

01:04:56.000 --> 01:04:57.000
Azhar Khan: Shall we continue?

01:04:59.000 --> 01:05:02.000
Dr. Khalifa: ...the word "God" from the beginning of the Quran to the end of Sura 9.

